    ('seed-review-goma-approved-replied', 'GOMA', 'seed-rev-res-goma-approved-replied', 'seed-prop-goma-lakeside', 'seed-host-goma-lake', 'seed-guest-goma-1', 5, 'Spotless villa and a quiet garden. The lake view at sunrise was worth the trip.', 'APPROVED', 'Asante sana, Jean-Pierre. We look forward to hosting you again.', '2026-09-14T08:00:00Z', 'seed-platform-reviewer', '2026-09-13T10:00:00Z', '2026-09-13T09:00:00Z', '2026-09-13T10:00:00Z'),
